{"4426670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hunt Zombies Together", "steam_appid": 4426670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt Zombies Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Zombies Together is a multiplayer FPS survival horror game set in a cursed mansion and its surrounding forest. Team up with your friends, survive relentless waves of zombies, and face terrifying supernatural threats lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the night… and that might be the real problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, responsive first-person shooter mechanics with a strong focus on immersion and tension. Every shot matters as you fight to stay alive against increasingly dangerous enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump-action shotgun with distance-based damage, spread, and recoil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim Down Sights (ADS) system with dynamic FOV change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headshot multiplier with gore and dismemberment effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit markers, blood feedback, and camera shake for impactful combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low health effects including heartbeat audio and darkened screen edges</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Co-op with Steam Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends, create lobbies, and survive together using full Steamworks integration. Cooperation is essential, but staying together will not always keep you safe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam lobby and friend invite system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based survival and exploration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies and Horror Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face both relentless undead and unique horror-driven enemies designed to create tension and unpredictability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard zombies that track players using line of sight and navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special boss enemy that can teleport across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscare mechanics that lock the player’s camera and trigger scripted attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-range encounters that emphasize fear and helplessness</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you want to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Endless waves of enemies until you die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed: Stay alive until the timer runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP: Fight against other players in competitive matches</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the challenge to match your skill level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impossible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty dynamically affects enemy count, health, and damage, providing a different survival experience every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark, haunted mansion and its eerie surroundings filled with secrets, threats, and unpredictable events. The game focuses heavily on tension, sound design, and environmental storytelling to create a constant sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Zombies Together delivers a cooperative survival horror FPS experience where teamwork, precision, and nerves of steel are the keys to making it through the night.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt Zombies Together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Zombies Together is a multiplayer FPS survival horror game set in a cursed mansion and its surrounding forest. Team up with your friends, survive relentless waves of zombies, and face terrifying supernatural threats lurking in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the night… and that might be the real problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, responsive first-person shooter mechanics with a strong focus on immersion and tension. Every shot matters as you fight to stay alive against increasingly dangerous enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump-action shotgun with distance-based damage, spread, and recoil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim Down Sights (ADS) system with dynamic FOV change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headshot multiplier with gore and dismemberment effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit markers, blood feedback, and camera shake for impactful combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low health effects including heartbeat audio and darkened screen edges</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Co-op with Steam Integration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends, create lobbies, and survive together using full Steamworks integration. Cooperation is essential, but staying together will not always keep you safe.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam lobby and friend invite system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based survival and exploration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies and Horror Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face both relentless undead and unique horror-driven enemies designed to create tension and unpredictability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard zombies that track players using line of sight and navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special boss enemy that can teleport across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscare mechanics that lock the player’s camera and trigger scripted attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-range encounters that emphasize fear and helplessness</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you want to survive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Endless waves of enemies until you die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed: Stay alive until the timer runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP: Fight against other players in competitive matches</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the challenge to match your skill level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impossible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each difficulty dynamically affects enemy count, health, and damage, providing a different survival experience every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark, haunted mansion and its eerie surroundings filled with secrets, threats, and unpredictable events. The game focuses heavily on tension, sound design, and environmental storytelling to create a constant sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Zombies Together delivers a cooperative survival horror FPS experience where teamwork, precision, and nerves of steel are the keys to making it through the night.</p>", "short_description": "Hunt Zombies Together is a co-op multiplayer FPS survival horror game where you and your friends battle waves of zombies and supernatural enemies inside a cursed mansion. Can be played by 1 to 4 people.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Germ